From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:45:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Optional multi-threading of the base OT loops

The 256 base OT instances a signature runs per pair of parties are independent of
each other. With CBMPC_BASE_OT_THREADS=N (default 1: unchanged) they are spread
over N threads. Messages and outputs are identical.

Written with the help of an AI tool (Claude).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FEFPxoVaygFeJXwvZUffGz
---
